# --- Paper Finder data (never committed) ---
# Downloaded CIE past papers are copyright of Cambridge Assessment; the extracted
# question bank is derived from them. Keep both out of version control, but keep
# the folders themselves (via .gitkeep) so the layout is obvious.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/raw/README.md
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
data/download_log.csv
*.pdf
papers.db
papers.db-journal
papers.db-wal
papers.db-shm
*.npy

